    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 43">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 43</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Dem ðu swiðe emne. Ne dem ðu oðerne dom þam welegan, oðerne ðam earman; ne oðerne þam liofran ⁊ oðerne þam laðran ne dem ðu.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Judge very evenly. Do not give one judgment to the rich man and another to the poor; nor one for a friend and another for an enemy.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Dem ðu swiþe rhytne dom; ⁊ ne dem þu oðerne dom ðam welegan, oþerne ðam earman; ne oðerne ðam liofan ond oþerne ðam laðan ne dæm ðu.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
